<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::intensity_conflict" target="global_financial_tension::yield_curve_slope" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Conflict escalation drives flight‑to‑quality into long‑duration government bonds while short‑term policy rates stay unchanged, compressing long minus short yields and flattening (or inverting) the curve.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">global_financial_tension</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::intensity_conflict" target="mideast_iran_us_conflict::shipping_insurance_premi" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A marked escalation in kinetic activity and high-profile strikes in the Russia–Ukraine theater amplifies global war-risk perceptions, prompting insurers to raise war-risk and political-risk premiums on shipments transiting exposed Middle Eastern chokepoints.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">mideast_iran_us_conflict</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::intensity_conflict" target="us_china_ai_tech_rivalry::tech_geopolitical_tensio" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A marked uptick in kinetic operations raises policymakers' threat perceptions and domestic political pressure, prompting faster adoption of technology export controls, investment screening and adversarial rhetoric that heighten tech-sector geopolitical tensions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_ai_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::intensity_conflict" target="us_trade_protectionism::asset_price_volatility" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalation in kinetic operations raises geopolitical risk premia and triggers rapid re‑pricing across commodity, equity and credit markets, directly increasing short‑term asset price volatility.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">us_trade_protectionism</data>
</edge>
